":"A secret organization, Crocodile, a private intelligence agency under the National Intelligence Service (NIS). \n\nCrocodile Bird, a freelance spy working there, codenamed Crocodile Bird, fights against the NIS, which seeks to kill his father and swallow up the organization!","year":2025,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":["Action","Crime"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/da5ef251-7609-4efb-8e2c-479777af2f50/ef7f8cc2-b95e-4cff-a4d6-7fe799b9aaaa.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":6,"follows":133,"listAt":"2026-10-29T22:50:23.880Z","chapters":[{"id":"3c17e5c1-2b2e-4be4-9779-32bb0d405ce6","number":"4","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-06-25T09:33:46+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"42b8408c-ddf4-468b-a970-c2aa5e295f38","number":"3","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2026-06-25T09:33:19+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"63135187-9483-4836-bf55-87a68e3b83d0","number":"2","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-06-25T09:32:39+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"1b2afae3-2e0f-4336-a018-1baf37be0be6","number":"1","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":16,"createdAt":"2026-06-25T09:31:56+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":4,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-26T19:10:53.055Z"},"32156657-0ea8-48a3-81fe-a29bb1f90219":{"id":"32156657-0ea8-48a3-81fe-a29bb1f90219","title":"Sasinpyowol","altTitle":"The Reaper","description":"He’s in the deepest part of the Jianghu. Keep your eyes wide open if you do not wish to get dragged into the abyss.\n\nKidnapped children raised 7 years in darkness for a single assassination mission that goes awry.\n\n---\nPyo Wol was an orphan who wandered around the continent until he bumped into a mysterious man and lost consciousness. When he wakes up, he finds himself in a dark, confined space with only one iron door for an exit. Wol survives the next several grueling months, trying to keep a cool head and stay in shape. When the iron door finally opens, he discovers he's not the only one in this miserable situation. A group of masked people has kidnapped 300 children to train them into human weapons. Wol must fight and kill the others, for only a handful of the strongest will be selected. Will Wol be able to become one of the chosen and find a way to free himself from his captors?\n\n---\n[Original Web Novel](https://page.kakao.com/content/55706014)\n\n**Original Webtoon:** [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%82%AC%EC%8B%A0%ED%91%9C%EC%9B%94/2937), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59771249)\n\n**Official Translations:**\n* [English](https://www.tappytoon.com/en/book/the-reaper)\n* [Chinese (Traditional) / 漢語](https://tw.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E6%AD%BB%E7%A5%9E%E6%BC%82%E6%9C%88/380)\n* [French / Français](https://piccoma.com/fr/product/614)\n* [German / Deutsch](https://www.tappytoon.com/de/book/the-reaper-de)\n* [Japanese / 日本語](https://piccoma.com/web/product/119365)","year":2022,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/32156657-0ea8-48a3-81fe-a29bb1f90219/96652862-746a-4a01-9a25-abd0010b73f1.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ko","availableLanguages":["en","uk","es-la","fr","hu","it","pl","pt-br","ka"],"lane":"manhwa","rating":8.73,"follows":9016,"listAt":"2026-10-29T22:50:28.987Z","chapters":[{"id":"39f1bc83-4139-4ad7-8f58-824e238e046a","number":"105","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":17,"createdAt":"2025-09-17T21:18:35+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"0fb1c2f0-a68c-41c4-8bd9-49cec788a539","number":"104","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2025-09-11T19:35:21+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"d9b749f1-9f0e-4fa4-9830-926cb997e899","number":"103","volume":null,"title":null,"lang":"en","pages":19,"createdAt":"2025-09-11T18:46:01+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCo